骨を並べては みんなほらライアー
Lining up bones, you're all liars, see?

3
00:03:32,116 --> 00:03:37,096
理屈だなんてゴミ箱は 身に覚えあるんでしょ アンサー
As for trash like excuses, you know it all too well, right? That's your answer.

4
00:03:37,096 --> 00:03:40,166
チク チク 痛いのね
It hurts with a prickling pain, doesn't it?

5
00:03:40,166 --> 00:03:43,196
エゴイズムに踊らされて 巻き込まれてく アンレ アンレ
Swept up in egoism, getting dragged into it, unles, unles!

6
00:03:46,196 --> 00:03:50,846
焼き付けて あくまでも 癒やしで当てましょう
Branding it on—no matter what, let's soothe it away with healing.

7
00:03:54,126 --> 00:03:56,126
ディンドン ディンドン
Ding-dong, ding-dong!

8
00:03:56,126 --> 00:03:58,206
響かせディンドン 笑い声 はは
Ringing out ding-dong, laughter—haha!

9
00:03:58,206 --> 00:04:00,126
と叫べ
Shout it out!

10
00:04:00,126 --> 00:04:03,116
ディンドンディンドン 鳴らしたよディンドン
Ding-dong, ding-dong, ring it out, ding-dong!

11
00:04:03,116 --> 00:04:06,116
破るのが先か 破るのが先か
Will you tear it off first, or will you break first?

12
00:04:06,116 --> 00:04:09,116
噛みつきやしないわ
I won't bite you, you know.

13
00:04:09,116 --> 00:04:12,116
慰めもしないわ
I won't comfort you either.

14
00:04:12,116 --> 00:04:15,116
私のものね
You're mine, aren't you?

15
00:04:15,116 --> 00:04:18,116
飽きたらのディスタンス
Once you're sick of it, no distance!

16
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:30,100
闇にまぎれて甘いチョコレート溶かして
Melting sweet chocolate hidden in the dark,

17
00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:33,100
くるみざみたくさん繋げて 剥ぎ取っていく
Tangled up and tightly bound, and stripped away step by step,

18
00:04:33,100 --> 00:04:36,100
鍵の姿化けて瞳を貸していく
Disguising as a key and lending my eyes,

19
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:39,200
ぴりつが痛むのね
It hurts sharply, doesn't it?

20
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:43,000
メカニズムに踊らされて 巻き込まれてく アンレ アンレ
Swept up in the mechanism, getting dragged into it, unles, unles!

21
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:47,300
間違えても正しくても
Whether you're wrong or right,

22
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:51,500
癒やして当てましょう まだダメですか？
Let's soothe it away—is it still not enough?

23
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,000
ディンドン ディンドン
Ding-dong, ding-dong!

24
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:57,800
狂わせディンドン 最後に はは と叫べ
Driving you crazy, ding-dong, finally shouting "Haha!"

25
00:04:57,800 --> 00:05:00,000
ディンドン ディンドン
Ding-dong, ding-dong!

26
00:05:00,090 --> 00:05:02,170
君好みアーカイブ 惨敗もマージン
The archives you like, a margin of utter defeat,

27
00:05:02,170 --> 00:05:04,008
後悔しないの 君に近付いた
without regrets, I drew closer to you

28
00:05:04,008 --> 00:05:06,108
昨日の飾りを 引き千切って
and tore off yesterday's decorations.

29
00:05:06,108 --> 00:05:08,390
さあ どうぞ お好きなの ear ear ear
Come, do as you like, with these ears, ears, ears!

30
00:05:08,390 --> 00:05:10,590
煩い通りは 少し苦手なの
I'm a little weak at bustling streets,

31
00:05:10,590 --> 00:05:12,830
繁華街の目を光らせる
my eyes glimmering in the shopping district.

32
00:05:12,830 --> 00:05:15,550
監視体制も ラクなもんじゃないね
Surveillance isn't an easy thing either,

33
00:05:15,550 --> 00:05:17,630
迂闊に昼寝も 出来ないくらいに
not even being able to take a siesta.

34
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:19,790
小娘一人は 傘一本
The lone young girl carries a single umbrella,

35
00:05:19,790 --> 00:05:21,910
爪を汚さずに 高みの見物
a spectator without sullying her claws.

36
00:05:21,910 --> 00:05:24,090
被った仮名は 私の真似？
Is that mask she wore an imitation of me?

37
00:05:24,090 --> 00:05:26,390
笑い飛ばしちゃうね
Don't make me laugh!

38
00:05:43,608 --> 00:05:45,908
アタマから手をとけて
Take your hands off my head,

39
00:05:45,908 --> 00:05:47,808
手をとけて
take them off,

40
00:05:47,808 --> 00:05:49,808
撫でたりしないで
don't pet me.

41
00:05:49,808 --> 00:05:53,928
あなたが アタマだけじゃなくなっちゃうの
You won't just be on my mind anymore—

42
00:05:53,928 --> 00:05:56,548
もう耐られない
I can't stand it!

43
00:06:11,108 --> 00:06:13,308
ヘッドホンは 外さない方が
Maybe it'd be better if

44
00:06:13,308 --> 00:06:15,508
いいんじゃないの？
you don't take your headphones off?

45
00:06:15,508 --> 00:06:17,808
君の攻略本 私のコレクション
Your strategy guides are my collection,

46
00:06:17,808 --> 00:06:20,508
色形サイズ 全て取り揃えています
assembled by color, shape, and size.

47
00:06:20,508 --> 00:06:22,808
二週間前は 可愛い赤色
Two weeks ago, it was a cute red;

48
00:06:22,808 --> 00:06:25,008
三日前は 確かなクールな青色
three days ago, a certain cool blue.

49
00:06:25,008 --> 00:06:27,508
今日の新作は 強気な紫
Today's new work is a confident purple;

50
00:06:27,508 --> 00:06:29,808
明日は君のその隣の邪魔な娘
tomorrow, it's that troublesome girl by your side.

51
00:06:29,808 --> 00:06:31,908
恋の敵のシルエット
The silhouette of a love rival

52
00:06:31,908 --> 00:06:34,208
重なる夜まで あと何時間
