414
00:35:15,878 --> 00:35:20,328
届けて 切なさには
Let it reach you, to this pain,

415
00:35:20,328 --> 00:35:24,828
名前をつけようか “Snow halation”
shall we give it a name? "Snow halation"

416
00:35:25,488 --> 00:35:30,988
想いが重なるまで 待てずに
Without waiting for our feelings to overlap,

417
00:35:31,588 --> 00:35:35,968
悔しいけど好きって純情
it's frustrating, but this pure feeling of "I love you"

